<view class="hero">
  <view class="hero-title">拍照，看看这顿多少热量</view>
  <view class="hero-sub">拍下或选一张食物照片，估算热量和营养</view>
  <view class="hero-btns">
    <button class="btn-primary hero-btn" bindtap="takePhoto">📷 拍照识别</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost hero-btn" bindtap="chooseAlbum">🖼 从相册选</button>
  </view>
  <view class="muted hero-note" wx:if="{{!hasEndpoint}}">当前为演示模式：可在结果页体验示例识别，也可手动搜索食物添加（热量计算是真实的）。在「我的」填入识别接口后即为真实 AI 识别。</view>
  <view class="hero-manual" bindtap="manualEntry">不拍照，手动记录一餐 ›</view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="row">
    <view>
      <view class="card-title">今日已摄入</view>
      <view><text class="big-kcal">{{today.kcal}}</text> <text class="muted">/ {{goal}} 千卡</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="spacer"></view>
    <view class="ring-wrap">
      <view class="ring"><view class="ring-fill" style="height: {{percent}}%;"></view><text class="ring-text">{{percent}}%</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width: {{percent}}%;"></view></view>
  <view class="row nutrients">
    <text>蛋白质 {{today.protein}}g</text><text>脂肪 {{today.fat}}g</text><text>碳水 {{today.carbs}}g</text>
    <view class="spacer"></view>
    <text class="muted" wx:if="{{remain >= 0}}">还可吃 {{remain}} 千卡</text>
    <text class="over" wx:else>已超出 {{over}} 千卡</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card" wx:if="{{recent.length}}">
  <view class="row"><view class="card-title">最近记录</view><view class="spacer"></view><text class="muted" bindtap="goHistory">全部 ›</text></view>
  <view class="recent-item" wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="goHistory">
    <image wx:if="{{item.image}}" class="thumb" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
    <view class="recent-main">
      <view>{{item.meal}} · {{item.names}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.timeText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="kcal">{{item.totalKcal}} 千卡</view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="card-title">小提示</view>
  <view class="muted tip">照片尽量俯拍、光线充足、食物不要互相遮挡，识别更准。份量估算会有误差，结果页可以手动调整克数。</view>
</view>
